  "description": "Seong Serim grew into womanhood without having ever felt love from a man. No matter how she used her body or her words, it never seemed to be enough. So when she meets Cha Juhyeok, who cares for her despite his cold demeanor, she is instantly smitten. Fast forward years later, and she is the successful CEO of her own entertainment company. One of her actors, Ha Yeonwu, will do anything to please his boss…anything. With two men vying for her attention, their touches both intoxicating, how is Serim supposed to choose? Well, maybe she doesn’t have to… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
